# Day 58 - Common Layout Patterns & Writing

## Learned

### Website Layout Patterns

- Single-column layout
  - Best for blogs, articles, and documentation websites.

- Two-column layout
  - Common for landing pages with text and images side by side.

- Card grid layout
  - Used for portfolios, product listings, services, and galleries.

- Sidebar layout
  - Common in dashboards, admin panels, and documentation sites.

- Hero section
  - The first section visitors see, containing a headline, description, and call-to-action.

- Sticky footer
  - Keeps the footer at the bottom of the page, even when there is little content.

